OL,3,ARTE to boycott Eurovision for second
OL,4,Ayear in a row
OL,5,
OL,6,FIrish broadcaster RTE will not
OL,7,Fbroadcast or participate in the 2027
OL,8,FEurovision Song Contest.
OL,10,FIt is the second year in a row that the
OL,11,Fbroadcaster has not participated in the
OL,12,Fcompetition.
OL,14,FIn 2026, RTE withdrew from the 2026
OL,15,Fcontest in Vienna, after the European
OL,16,FBroadcasting Union confirmed that
OL,17,FIsraeli public broadcaster KAN would be
OL,18,Fallowed to take part.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
